        <profile name="Seeker of Diving Arcana" id="84d7-fcb5-e418-7a17" hidden="false" typeId="f887-5881-0e6d-755c" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">STRATEGIC GAMBIT. You can immediately change this operative&apos;s order and/or it can immediately perform a free **Omniscanner**, **Fall Back**, **Place Marker**, **Pick Up Marker**, **Reposition** or mission action. If it&apos;s the **Fall Back** or **Reposition** action and this operative isn&apos;t carrying a marker, it must end that action either within your drop zone (if this isn&apos;t possible, then as close as possible to it), or with an objective marker or one of your mission markers within its control range.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
