            <profile name="Achillan Eye" id="7cdf-3504-a957-d878" hidden="false" typeId="f887-5881-0e6d-755c" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">Whenever a friendly BATTLECLADE operative is shooting an enemy operative visible to this operative, that friendly operative&apos;s ranged weapons have the Saturate weapon rule. This rule has no effect if this operative is within control range of an enemy operative.</characteristic>
